Subject: [PATCH 06/15] ops: EachNode keeps the closedness test and defers only
 the proof

An operand with no standing proof counts as a solid exactly when is_manifold_solid says it is
closed; an open operand stays a sheet. A solid-expect result is still tested for closedness in
finish_proved (an open result is Error::NotSolid inside the node), and only its outward proof is
left to the node's prove_on. Tests: a closed operand's expect is SOLID while an open result
under it is NotSolid; a sheet boolean matches EachStep.

